GT patch 0032: record only state changes. A race records ~10,000 draws a frame, mostly with the state of the
draw before, and the driver's CPU time was 13 % of the process. The geometry buffer is bound once per frame;
the pipeline, scissor and blend constants only when they change; a draw with the same uniforms and texture as
the draw before reuses its uniform slot and descriptor binding. What is drawn is the same.

